.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH folders 1  "folders " 
.SH NAME
folders \- Manage synchronized folders (bare: list managed folders)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfolders\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage synchronized folders (bare: list managed folders)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
folders\-create(1)
Create a synchronized folder and print a read\-only join ticket/URL (\-\-write for write access, \-\-no\-share to skip)
.TP
folders\-join(1)
Join a folder from an Iroh document ticket
.TP
folders\-leave(1)
Leave a synchronized folder, optionally deleting its local files
.TP
folders\-import(1)
Import local files into a synchronized folder
.TP
folders\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
